    <h2>Book 2: Chamber of Secrets</h2>
    <img class="story-banner" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/M/MV5BNGJhM2M2MWYtZjIzMC00MDZmLThkY2EtOWViMDhhYjRhMzk4XkEyXkFqcGc@._V1_FMjpg_UX1000_.jpg" alt="Chamber of Secrets">
    <p class="story-body">An ancient terror strikes Hogwarts as students are mysteriously turned to stone by an unseen monster. Whispers fill the corridors that the legendary Chamber of Secrets has been opened once again by the Heir of Slytherin, forcing Harry, Ron, and Hermione to brew dangerous Polyjuice Potion and venture deep into the pipes below to confront a dark spirit trapped inside a diary.</p>
